OL,3,GNEWSAAirport workers' half-term strike
OL,4,Asuspended
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanned strikes by more than 130
OL,7,Fworkers at Leeds Bradford Airport (LBA)
OL,8,Fduring the school half-term period have
OL,9,Fbeen suspended to allow for fresh pay
OL,10,Fnegotiations.
OL,12,FUnite union members, including air
OL,13,Ftraffic controllers and hourly paid
OL,14,Fstaff such as passport control workers
OL,15,Fand passenger assistance, had been due
OL,16,Fto walk out from 23 October to 2
OL,17,FNovember in a dispute for pay parity
OL,18,Fwith colleagues in Newcastle.
OL,20,FBoth groups had "heavily rejected" the
OL,21,Fairport's latest pay offers, the union
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
